# A set of receivers that is not complete says what is expected. At an access whose receiver has no type and at which the unknown object arrives, or an object without a layout (an array, a closure),
# the receivers are the layouts that are seen to arrive beside it and have a field of the name, and the set ends in `..`: whoever reads it tests. Where no such layout arrives there are no receivers,
# and none where a built-in object that arrives answers the name by itself (`length` of an array): there the layout is the odd one. A receiver with a type keeps all the layouts of its type, also the one that is not seen to arrive.
# The site names the loss all the same: what took the proof away, and where.
# The unknown object is explained by how it came into being, and without the edges to walk back the access is its own witness. An object without a layout is explained by where it is made.
# At the end: the same read with the object alone has a complete set and no loss
# RUN: valueflow-apply
# RUN(RESULTS): valueflow-results
# RESULTS: access [[unknown]] function=f1 kind=Read loss cause=[[source]] witness=f1:v1
# RESULTS-NEXT: access [[array]] function=f2 kind=Read loss cause=NonLayoutObject witness=f0:v4
# RESULTS-NEXT: access [[closure]] function=f3 kind=Read loss cause=NonLayoutObject witness=f6
# RESULTS-NEXT: access [[alone]] function=f4 kind=Read loss cause=NonLayoutObject witness=f0:v4
# RESULTS-NEXT: access [[complete]] function=f5 kind=Read
# RESULTS-NOT: loss
# RESULTS: access [[answered]] function=f7 kind=Read loss cause=NonLayoutObject witness=f0:v4
# RESULTS-NEXT: access [[typed]] function=f8 kind=Read
# RESULTS-NOT: loss

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js" body=f0
entry module=m0
layout L0 name="Circle" fields=[{key="side" declared={type=anything} flags=[IsRequired]}, {key="length" declared={type=anything} flags=[IsRequired]}]
layout L1 name="Square" fields=[{key="side" declared={type=anything} flags=[IsRequired]}]
function f0 name="main" kind=Module results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0():
    v0 = Integer integer=1
    v1 = NewObject -, v0, v0 layout=L0 fields=[0, 1]
    v2 = Builtin builtin=GlobalThis
    v3 = PropGet v2 key="outside" [isFreeName]
    v4 = NewArray v0 contents=anything
    v5 = NewClosure function=f6
    v6 = CallDirect v1 function=f1
    v7 = CallDirect v3 function=f1
    v8 = CallDirect v1 function=f2
    v9 = CallDirect v4 function=f2
    v10 = CallDirect v1 function=f3
    v11 = CallDirect v5 function=f3
    v12 = CallDirect v4 function=f4
    v13 = CallDirect v1 function=f5
    v14 = CallDirect v1 function=f7
    v15 = CallDirect v4 function=f7
    v16 = NewObject -, v0 layout=L1 fields=[0]
    v17 = NewClosure function=f8
    v18 = CallDirect v1 function=f8
    v19 = Call v3, -, v17, v16
    Return
}
function f1 name="unknownObjectAmongReceivers" parameters=[{type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything):
    v1 = PropGet v0 key="side"
    Return v1
}
